      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "created": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "① 选中矩形。\n② 分别拖角手柄与四边手柄。\n③ 按住 Shift 拖角手柄锁比例。\n④ 拖出去再拖回原处。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "① 选中矩形。\n② 分别拖角手柄与四边手柄。\n③ 按住 Shift 拖角手柄锁比例。\n④ 拖出去再拖回原处。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
