      "originalText": "期望：报三个图形的共同包围盒尺寸，随拖动实时变化；\n角手柄按住 Shift 锁比例。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "id17",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 2320,
      "width": 656,
      "height": 33,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2329",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "created": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6．一处必须过目的改动：缩放 / 旋转时选择框不再消失",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6．一处必须过目的改动：缩放 / 旋转时选择框不再消失",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "id18",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 2368,
      "width": 568,
      "height": 85,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2329",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "created": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "① 单击右边那个矩形选中，先看清选择框与八个手柄。\n② 按住它的一个角手柄往外拖，别松手，盯着选择框和手柄看。\n③ 松开，换旋转柄再试一次。\n④ 在空白处按下拖出框选，拖到一半时按一下 Shift，然后继续拖完松手。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "① 单击右边那个矩形选中，先看清选择框与八个手柄。\n② 按住它的一个角手柄往外拖，别松手，盯着选择框和手柄看。\n③ 松开，换旋转柄再试一次。\n④ 在空白处按下拖出框选，拖到一半时按一下 Shift，然后继续拖完松手。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "id19",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 2467,
      "width": 778,
      "height": 85,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2329",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "created": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "期望：整个拖拽过程中选择框与手柄始终可见，读数持续更新。\n修复前：一旦按下，选择框、手柄、读数会整块消失——按下时会建一枚零尺寸的框选草稿\n写进 appState.selectionElement，而渲染层「画选中元素」整块以 !selectionElement 为门槛。\n第 ④ 步是防回退：框选中途按修饰键，框选框不能消失，松手后仍要选中框内图形。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "期望：整个拖拽过程中选择框与手柄始终可见，读数持续更新。\n修复前：一旦按下，选择框、手柄、读数会整块消失——按下时会建一枚零尺寸的框选草稿\n写进 appState.selectionElement，而渲染层「画选中元素」整块以 !selectionElement 为门槛。\n第 ④ 步是防回退：框选中途按修饰键，框选框不能消失，松手后仍要选中框内图形。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "id20",
      "type": "text",
