      "text": "实现落点：packages/element/src/transformStatus.ts（报什么）、\npackages/excalidraw/components/App.transformStatus.ts（悬停态与手势增量）、\npackages/excalidraw/renderer/interactiveScene.ts（气泡与锚点）。",
